{"id":71339,"date":"2026-10-29T19:29:57","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:29:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71339"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:31:28","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:31:28","slug":"backyard-trilho-dos-cagados","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/backyard-trilho-dos-cagados\/","title":{"rendered":"Backyard Trilho dos C\u00e1gados 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Backyard Trilho dos C\u00e1gados 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Backyard Trilho dos C\u00e1gados 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de Maio de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com in\u00edcio marcado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique<\/strong>, no concelho do <strong>Cartaxo<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Integrado no calend\u00e1rio nacional de resist\u00eancia por elimina\u00e7\u00e3o hor\u00e1ria, o evento desafia os atletas nos caminhos rurais do cora\u00e7\u00e3o da lez\u00edria e bairro ribatejano.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o disputa-se num circuito circular segundo as regras de Backyard Ultra (partida a cada hora em ponto), disponibilizando quatro desafios distintos: a prova rainha <strong>Ultra<\/strong> (elimina\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 restar o \u00faltimo atleta em prova), bem como os patamares de <strong>12 Voltas<\/strong>, <strong>6 Voltas<\/strong> e <strong>3 Voltas<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado percorre a paisagem vin\u00edcola de Vila Ch\u00e3 de Ourique, terra de forte tradi\u00e7\u00e3o vitivin\u00edcola nas encostas suaves que antecedem o vale do Tejo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da equipa <strong>Trilho dos C\u00e1gados<\/strong>, garantindo o suporte t\u00e9cnico de base de vida e cronometragem a cada volta completada. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><stro